# Local development (npx wrangler dev). On a real account the bootstrapper
# sets both of these.
#
# The root of the key that seals the installer's state: any long random
# value, never changed afterwards (e.g. openssl rand -hex 32).
INSTALLER_STATE_KEY=
# The handoff, so you can sign in: README.md "The contract with the
# bootstrapper" has the JSON. Put the SHA-256 of a code of your choice in
# handoffCodeHash, then open http://localhost:8787/handoff?code=<that code>.
BOOTSTRAP_CONFIG=
